WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:02,380
He has no ill intentions, little sister

2
00:00:02,380 --> 00:00:03,900
Your little snake is very busy now

3
00:00:03,900 --> 00:00:05,700
He represents the Bank of China.

4
00:00:05,700 --> 00:00:07,140
It's rude to the shrine

5
00:00:07,140 --> 00:00:08,860
Please forgive me, Mrs. Fang.

6
00:00:11,910 --> 00:00:14,560
What does this mean

7
00:00:14,560 --> 00:00:16,280
This is a matter between Shentang and Bai Ze

8
00:00:16,280 --> 00:00:17,760
Gods don’t slap little ones in the face, right?

9
00:00:17,760 --> 00:00:19,120
Die, I die, I kill

10
00:00:19,120 --> 00:00:21,320
What happened today was a misunderstanding

11
00:00:21,320 --> 00:00:22,560
I hope Mrs. Fang will forgive me.

12
00:00:22,560 --> 00:00:24,080
You really can go and have a baby

13
00:00:24,080 --> 00:00:25,080
Then you can go and give birth

14
00:00:25,080 --> 00:00:26,040
What belongs deeply is no return

15
00:00:26,040 --> 00:00:27,200
No return, no return

16
00:00:27,200 --> 00:00:28,120
What are you shouting about?

17
00:00:28,120 --> 00:00:29,840
Can I still know that the Son of God will never return?

18
00:00:34,220 --> 00:00:35,780
What are you looking at?

19
00:00:35,780 --> 00:00:37,100
What's the use of threatening me?

20
00:00:37,100 --> 00:00:38,380
Take you away and curse now

21
00:00:38,380 --> 00:00:39,580
Mother and son are stupid pigs

22
00:00:39,580 --> 00:00:41,540
I'll kneel down and give you one on the spot.

23
00:00:41,540 --> 00:00:45,210
Brother Shenzi, I don’t need to introduce it to you.

24
00:00:45,210 --> 00:00:46,370
Bai Ze is busy

25
00:00:46,370 --> 00:00:48,570
I wasn't targeting you just now, but

26
00:00:48,570 --> 00:00:50,010
If so, I hope you can listen.
